  "goodToKnow": "Das Gemeindehaus is a parish hall or community centre, usually belonging to a church congregation: Gemeindehaus der evangelischen Kirche. It hosts choir rehearsals, youth groups, flea markets and the classic Kaffee und Kuchen after events. Die Gemeinde means both a municipality and a church congregation. Municipal community centres are often called Bürgerhaus. Plural: die Gemeindehäuser."
